# Build context for the boring-door image (dockerfile: agents/door/Dockerfile, context: .).
# Docker cannot re-include a file under an excluded parent, so each parent dir
# is re-included one level at a time; everything else stays out of the context.
**
!agents
!agents/door
!agents/door/**
!data
!data/contract
!data/contract/**
agents/door/Dockerfile
**/__pycache__
